---
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="About — Michael Baker" description="Twenty years working with content, and an expanding collection of tools and experiences I build." /><ClientRouter /></head>
<body><Header /><main id="main-content">
<p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / THE PERSON BEHIND THE PROJECTS</p>
<h1>Content, systems,<br />and creative tools.</h1>
<div class="about-grid"><div class="portrait" role="img" aria-label="Portrait placeholder. A photograph of Michael will go here."><div aria-hidden="true" class="portrait-art">mb<span>↗</span></div><span class="eyebrow">PORTRAIT / TO COME</span></div>
<div class="story"><p class="lead">I’m Michael. I like exploring different kinds of work—and finding ways to make that work easier or more enjoyable.</p>
<p>For eighteen years, I worked at a large private art and design university, including a management role producing content for online courses and curricula. The work brought together writing, images, and video to help people learn creative subjects.</p>
<p>Since then, I’ve produced marketing and operations content for enterprise technology companies, worked as an AI trainer, and copy edited for a DevOps news publication. Much of my career has involved instructional or procedural material: helping someone understand a subject, follow a process, or get something done.</p>
<p>I’ve been using computers since the early ’80s. They’ve always been part of how I explore my interests, from art and music to nature and design. Coding gives me another way to participate: I can build an experience I wish existed and see what happens when I use it.</p>
<p>My current projects include <a href="/projects/sketchlet">Sketchlet</a>, a daily drawing playground, and <a href="/projects/baker-parks">Baker Parks</a>, an exploration of public parks information and accessibility. I develop these prototypes with AI assistance, refining them through use and learning as I go.</p>
<p>This site documents the experiments, the decisions behind them, and the details that take more work than expected.</p>
<div class="story-links"><a href="/projects">Explore the projects ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/michael-baker-content">Find me on GitHub ↗</a></div>
</div></div>
<section class="experience"><div class="section-heading"><h2>A few connected threads</h2></div><div class="threads"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / EDUCATION</p><h3>Making ideas teachable.</h3><p>Online art and design courses, curricula, and the written and visual material that makes learning possible.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / TECHNOLOGY</p><h3>Making complexity usable.</h3><p>Enterprise content production, procedural information, AI training, and technical copy editing.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / EXPERIMENTATION</p><h3>Making room to try.</h3><p>Personal prototypes that connect my interests with practical tools, creative play, and new ways to learn.</p></div></div></section>
</main><Footer /></body></html>
<style>
h1 { max-width:900px; margin:22px 0 55px; }.about-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.65fr; gap:70px; align-items:start; }.portrait { aspect-ratio:4/5; background:var(--bg-surface); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; background-image:radial-gradient(var(--border) 1px,transparent 1px); background-size:12px 12px; }.portrait-art { font:700 110px var(--font-syne); letter-spacing:-.1em; color:var(--accent); padding-top:30px; }.portrait-art span { display:block; font-size:90px; color:var(--orange); padding-left:40%; }.lead { font-size:1.5rem; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text); }.story { color:var(--text-muted); }.story-links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:25px; border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-top:24px; font:12px var(--font-mono); }.experience { margin-top:80px; }.threads { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:40px; }.threads h3 { font-size:1.35rem; }.threads p:last-child { font-size:15px; color:var(--text-muted); }
@media(max-width:720px) { .about-grid,.threads { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:32px; }.portrait { aspect-ratio:3/2; max-width:400px; }.portrait-art { padding-top:0; font-size:65px; }.portrait-art span { display:inline; font-size:65px; padding-left:20px; } }
</style>
